      "INDIA: So cute!\nANNABEL: SO cute!!",
      "ELSPETH: Well, I mean, they probably don’t have rehab in Liverpool.\nPOOR DEAR PAMELA: No, gosh, no. No, I can’t imagine they do.\nELSPETH: Everybody just goes to ruin, I suppose.\nPOOR DEAR PAMELA: Where is Liverpool?",
